# src/ is BUILD OUTPUT here, not source, and that inversion is the point.
#
# The engine's generated wire types are copied in from the pinned commit by
# scripts/vendor-engine-types.mjs on every build. Committing the copy would
# start the divergent lineage the engine's never-fork rule exists to prevent,
# and would put a second definition of the wire format in a repository whose
# whole discipline is that spec/schemas is the only normative source.
#
# sdk/python/.gitignore ignores src/ziffer/_engine/ for exactly this reason.
src/
